<title>JAPAN: Mori Denki ask-only in early morning.</title>
<headline>Mori Denki ask-only in early morning.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Mori Denki Manufacturing Co Ltd were ask-only on Thursday morning, depressed by the news that the industrial lighting equipment maker would raise a smaller amount of equity through new share issues than originally planned, brokers said.</p>
<p>The shares were ask-only at 455 yen at 0120 GMT, lower than Wednesday's closing at 485 yen.</p>
</text>
